1
00:00:01,375 --> 00:00:02,750
Introduction.

2
00:00:04,583 --> 00:00:06,583
Throughout your radiation treatment,

3
00:00:06,583 --> 00:00:11,708
it is very important to eat well
and pay close attention to your nutrition.

4
00:00:11,916 --> 00:00:15,000
Ideally,
this means eating without restrictions

5
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:19,833
as much of the foods you wish to eat 
to sustain a healthy body weight.

6
00:00:20,208 --> 00:00:23,541
Taking in enough nutrition and calories is important

7
00:00:23,541 --> 00:00:28,500
 to your body’s ability to bounce back and 
heal in between radiation treatments. 

8
00:00:28,750 --> 00:00:31,958
Without
appropriate nutrition and caloric intake

9
00:00:31,958 --> 00:00:35,000
harmful effects from radiation
exposure can build up

10
00:00:35,375 --> 00:00:39,666
and your healthy tissues will not recover
as quickly from day to day.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,041
This video will explain common
nutrition challenges during treatment.

12
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:47,000
Introduce you to your nutrition
support team

13
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:50,750
and explain ways that we can support
you if you do lose weight.
